    "body": "@domenic PTAL\r\n\r\nI intentionally left it vague how to fetch the critical subresources, following [what we are doing for `link`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#fetching-and-processing-a-resource-from-a-link-element:critical-subresources). How exactly critical subresources should be fetched and processed are largely unspecified, but fortunately it seems that we don't need to get into it for this particular spec bug.",
